isConsteval.doc:
Matches consteval function declarations and if consteval/if ! consteval
statements.

Given:
  consteval int a();
  void b() { if consteval {} }
  void c() { if ! consteval {} }
  void d() { if ! consteval {} else {} }
functionDecl(isConsteval())
  matches the declaration of "int a()".
ifStmt(isConsteval())
  matches the if statement in "void b()", "void c()", "void d()".

