isLeftFold.doc:
Matches left-folding fold expressions.

Example matches `(0 + ... + args)`
    (matcher = cxxFoldExpr(isLeftFold()))
  template <typename... Args>
  auto sum(Args... args) {
      return (0 + ... + args);
  }

  template <typename... Args>
  auto multiply(Args... args) {
      return (args * ... * 1);
  }

