isMemberInitializer.doc:
Matches a constructor initializer if it is initializing a member, as
opposed to a base.

Given
  struct B {};
  struct D : B {
    int I;
    D(int i) : I(i) {}
  };
  struct E : B {
    E() : B() {}
  };
cxxConstructorDecl(hasAnyConstructorInitializer(isMemberInitializer()))
  will match D(int), but not match E().

